{"sections":[{"slug":"赋值环","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"赋值环"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">赋值环</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"赋值环"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $K$ <span lang=\"zh\">为域</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">若整环</span> $\\mathscr O \\subset K$ <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span> $\\mathscr O\\neq K$, <span lang=\"zh\">且对任意</span> $x\\in K$ <span lang=\"zh\">都有</span> $x\\in \\mathscr O$ <span lang=\"zh\">或</span> $x^{-1}\\in \\mathscr O$, <span lang=\"zh\">则称</span> $\\mathscr O$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $K$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的赋值环</span> (valuation ring).</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">特别地</span>, $K$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\mathscr O$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/分式域","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">分式域</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一个整环若是其分式域中的赋值环</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则称其为赋值环</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">赋值</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathscr O$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $K$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的赋值环</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">令</span> $V = K^\\times / \\mathscr O^\\times$, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $\\mathscr O$ <span lang=\"zh\">定义的赋值</span> (valuation) <span lang=\"zh\">映射是</span> $\\nu\\colon K^\\times \\to V$. <span lang=\"zh\">群</span> $V$ <span lang=\"zh\">称作</span> $\\mathscr O$ <span lang=\"zh\">的赋值群</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">一般的习惯是将</span> $V$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的运算写作加法</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">特别地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $[1]=0$. <span lang=\"zh\">有时我们还将赋值延拓到</span> $K$ <span lang=\"zh\">上</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $\\nu(0)=\\infty$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对</span> $[a],[b]\\in V$, <span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $a^{-1}b \\in\\mathscr O$, <span lang=\"zh\">则记</span> $[a]\\leq [b]$. <span lang=\"zh\">对任意</span> $v\\in V$ <span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $v\\leq\\infty$. <span lang=\"zh\">容易验证</span>\n$$\r\n\\nu(a+b)\\geq\\min\\{\\nu(a),\\nu(b)\\}.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">局部环</span></h3>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">赋值环是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/局部环","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">局部环</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><em><span lang=\"zh\">证明</span></em>. <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathscr O$ <span lang=\"zh\">是赋值环</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">对任意</span> $x\\in \\mathscr O$ ($x\\neq 0,1$), <span lang=\"zh\">在分式域中</span> $\\frac{x}{1-x}$, $\\frac{1-x}{x}$ <span lang=\"zh\">之一属于</span> $\\mathcal O$, <span lang=\"zh\">这说明</span> $x,1-x$ <span lang=\"zh\">之一可逆</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">故</span> $\\mathscr O$ <span lang=\"zh\">为局部环</span>.\n(<span lang=\"zh\">这个证明使用了</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/排中律","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">排中律</span>"}},{"Plain":".)</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">理想</span></h3>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $\\mathscr O$ <span lang=\"zh\">为赋值环</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $\\mathscr O$ <span lang=\"zh\">有唯一的极大理想</span> $P=\\{x\\in\\mathscr O\\mid\\nu(x)&gt;0\\}$, <span lang=\"zh\">且当</span> $\\nu(a)\\neq\\nu(b)$ <span lang=\"zh\">时</span>, $\\nu(a+b) = \\min\\{\\nu(a),\\nu(b)\\}$.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">一个赋值环的全体理想构成一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/全序集","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">全序</span>"}},{"Plain":".\n<span lang=\"zh\">特别地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">任何两个元素之间有整除关系</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/非Archimedes赋值域","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">非</span> Archimedes <span lang=\"zh\">赋值域</span>"}},{"Plain":" $(K,|{-}|)$, <span lang=\"zh\">其整数环</span> $\\mathcal O_K = \\{x\\in K \\mid |x| \\leq 1\\}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为赋值环</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}